                <pb facs="0896" n="776" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg776"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Eddy to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-10-28"><hi rendition="#italic">October 28,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Eddy reports the situation unchanged. There is no rioting in St. Petersburg,
                    and all communication has ceased throughout the Empire.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
